---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact TechPilot AI" description="Contact TechPilot AI with feedback, corrections, and topic suggestions.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span>
    <h1>Let's make tech <span style="color:var(--mint)">more useful.</span></h1>
    <p>We welcome thoughtful feedback, correction requests, and ideas for future guides.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="contact-box">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Contact us by email</h2>
    <p>Have a question, spotted an error, or want to suggest an AI tool or topic? Send us an email and we’ll get back to you as soon as we can.</p>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact1techpilotai@gmail.com">contact1techpilotai@gmail.com</a></p>
    <p><a href="mailto:contact1techpilotai@gmail.com">Email TechPilot AI</a></p>
    <p>For corrections, please include the article title or page link, the detail that needs updating, and a reliable source when possible.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>